Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.95,0:00:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}Hello，我是{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}樂環實業 EcoJoy{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46} 的鐵男
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.05,0:00:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}在這邊要跟大家推薦{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}湛智的棍子{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.55,0:00:14.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}這是透過他的{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}輔導跟陪跑{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.35,0:00:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}在我們這個新創的 EcoJoy 團隊裡面
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.65,0:00:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}創造了{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}很大的價值{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.80,0:00:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}我們是一個{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}微型的團隊{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.40,0:00:27.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}但是我覺得創造出來的效能
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}遠比原本團隊的大概 {\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}5 倍{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}至少有 {\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}5 倍的效果{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.30,0:00:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}包含透過 AI 去{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}釐清我們的思維{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}跟 {\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}Business Model 的修正{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.10,0:00:45.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}還有小小團隊的一些行政事務
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.55,0:00:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}透過這些棍子教的 AI
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.75,0:00:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}可以{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}大大的降低{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}我們這些
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.45,0:00:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}重複性事務的成本{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}最直接的就是，這樣的事情
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.42,0:01:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}就{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}不用再去請一個助理小妹{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.78,0:01:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}再去做一些很無聊的事情
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.30,0:01:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}然後這助理小妹又覺得
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.20,0:01:08.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}這個工作很無聊之類的
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}那這樣子透過 AI
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.75,0:01:15.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}我覺得可以讓團隊的{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}向心力更強大{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:15.35,0:01:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}因為每個人都是做{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}更有價值的事情{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.25,0:01:22.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}在這邊誠心的跟大家推薦{\c&H3DD9FF&\fs50}湛智的棍子{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs46}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.55,0:01:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(70,70)}謝謝
